Here is the commit message:
SOLR-9029: fix rare ZkStateReader visibility race during
 collection state format update

Here is the root cause:
The bug is caused by a visibility race condition in the `ZkStateReader` class when updating the collection state format. This occurs when the system attempts to access or refresh the state of a collection that may not yet be fully recognized or updated in the cluster state, leading to potential inconsistencies or failures in recognizing new or legacy collections.

